{"ref": "Shulchan Arukh, Orach Chayim 633:1", "heRef": "שולחן ערוך, אורח חיים תרל״ג:א׳", "sectionRef": "Shulchan Arukh, Orach Chayim 633", "indexTitle": "Shulchan Arukh, Orach Chayim", "heIndexTitle": "שולחן ערוך, אורח חיים", "categories": ["Halakhah", "Shulchan Arukh"], "next": "Shulchan Arukh, Orach Chayim 634", "sectionNames": ["Siman", "Seif"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Maginei Eretz: Shulchan Aruch Orach Chaim, Lemberg, 1893", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002084080", "text": "<b>דין גובה הסוכה. ובו י סעיפים:</b><br><i data-commentator=\"Be'er HaGolah\" data-label=\"א\" data-order=\"1\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Ateret Zekenim\" data-label=\"♦\" data-order=\"1\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishnah Berurah\" data-label=\"א\"></i>סוכה שהיא גבוה למעלה <i data-commentator=\"Ba'er Hetev\" data-order=\"1\"></i>מעשרים <i data-commentator=\"Mishnah Berurah\" data-label=\"ב\"></i>אמה <i data-commentator=\"Magen Avraham\" data-order=\"1\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Ba'er Hetev\" data-order=\"2\"></i>פסולה <i data-commentator=\"Be'er HaGolah\" data-label=\"ב\" data-order=\"2\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Turei Zahav\" data-order=\"1\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Mishnah Berurah\" data-label=\"ג\"></i>בין שהיא גדולה בין שהיא קטנה בין שמחיצות מגיעות לסכך <i data-commentator=\"Mishnah Berurah\" data-label=\"ד\"></i>בין שאינן מגיעות אבל עשרים כשרה <i data-commentator=\"Be'er HaGolah\" data-label=\"ג\" data-order=\"3\"></i>אפי' כל סככה למעלה מעשרים כיון שאין בחללה אלא עשרים:"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org", "text": "<b> The Laws of the Height of a Sukkah, 10 Seifim</b><br>  A sukkah which is taller than twenty amot is invalid, whether it is large or small, whether its walls reach the schach or they do not reach the schach. However, a twenty amot tall sukkah is valid, even if all of its schach is above twenty [amot] because its interior is only twenty [amot]."}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Maginei Eretz: Shulchan Aruch Orach Chaim, Lemberg, 1893", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002084080"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Torat Emet 363", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "http://www.toratemetfreeware.com/index.html?downloads"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org"}]}